  "method": "Three curl GETs per page. Fresh TLS connection each page run through the managed HTTPS proxy. Compression negotiated by curl. CDN state observed without purging. Not mobile-throttled browser measurements. API uses 20 sequential GETs with reused connection, two endpoints concurrent. p95 nearest rank includes the initial request. Endpoint distributions distinguish TTFB from full-response duration. Cache-HIT full-response distributions exclude observed misses.",
  "limitations": [
    "Headless Chromium launch failed because socket() was not permitted. Sandbox escalation was rejected by automatic policy. Cloud browser surface has no CDP throttling/performance interface.",
    "LCP, CLS, INP, browser total transfer, observed JavaScript transfer and request count are unmeasured.",
    "Fresh-connection page TTFB includes approximately 3\u20135.6 seconds of managed proxy TLS setup and is not representative of direct visitor TTFB. Endpoint samples retain full timing and post-connection timing separately.",
    "Cold origin/edge cache was not forced. Backend API and database EXPLAIN ANALYZE were not accessible; Svelte navigation data is explicitly labeled separately from origin backend API.",
    "Public Grimoire admission-gated routes are excluded: their corpus must not be SSR-rendered before Turnstile admission. Retired campsites and dr-jobs routes are intentionally 404.",
    "source_commit identifies the checkout inspected. The exact deployed revision was not verified for this baseline."
